  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "PVE禁止入侵并鼓励合作修仙，PVP则允许攻打其他宗门、掠夺资源并按赛季结算",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Cultivation Tales has two game modes: PVE and PVP. In PVE mode, players must cultivate immortals cooperatively because they are not allowed to invade other factions. But in PVP mode, you can invade other players’ factions and plunder their resources, putting everyone against one another. This mode is full of challenges, and it will conclude at the end of the battle season.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1504570/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "迷宫通关后从祭坛获得仅限该区域使用的随机能力，积累到挑战迷宫领主",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Players can get random abilities to become more and more powerful - sooner or later they will be strong enough to challenge the Lord of Labyrinth. These abilities are too powerful to control so they can only be used in this territory.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1504570/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "除步行外还能御剑飞行、水上奔跑、游泳甚至装死，用移动技辅助采集与战斗",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "To explore the world, walking is not the only option: you can dodge, stand on your sword to fly, run on the water, swim, and even feign death. These skills can help you gather materials more efficiently and help you fight those formidable monsters.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1504570/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
